---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { alternatesFor } from "../data/i18n";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

const updated = "September 23, 2026";
---

<Layout
  alternates={alternatesFor("/privacy")} title="Privacy Policy" description="How ConvertBrio collects, uses, and protects your data and files, including how long uploads are kept and when they are deleted.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow={`Last updated ${updated}`} title="Privacy Policy" />

  <section class="bg-canvas">
    <div class="container-page py-16 sm:py-20">
      <article class="prose prose-neutral max-w-2xl prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-[-0.01em] prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">
        <p>
          ConvertBrio (“we”, “us”, or “our”) provides online tools for converting, compressing,
          and enhancing files. ConvertBrio is independently operated by Subham Sharma, based in
          India. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the
          choices you have. It applies to convertbrio.com and every tool on it.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          ConvertBrio is independently operated by Subham Sharma from India. For any privacy
          question, correction, or rights request, contact <a href="mailto:subhamsharma@convertbrio.com">subhamsharma@convertbrio.com</a> or use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account information</strong> you provide, such as your name and email address.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact-form submissions</strong>, including the message and reply-to email you give us.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Technical data</strong> such as IP address, browser type, device type, and
            operating system, collected automatically to operate the service securely and
            diagnose problems.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Usage data</strong>, such as which tools and pages you visit and how you interact with them.</li>
          <li><strong>Security logs</strong> used to detect abuse, rate-limit requests, and keep the service reliable.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Files you upload</h2>
        <p>
          Files you upload are transmitted over an encrypted (HTTPS/TLS) connection. Your original
          file is sent directly to a private Vercel Blob store, read from there once to perform
          the conversion, compression, or enhancement you requested, and then deleted immediately
          afterward on a best-effort basis. The converted result is separately written to
          temporary storage (Supabase) so it stays available for you to download. We do not
          manually review, share, or use the contents of your files for any purpose other than
          delivering the result you requested, including for AI tools such as the image enhancer,
          upscaler, and background remover, where uploaded files are used only to produce your
          output and are never used to train or improve any model. The temporary copy of your
          converted result is deleted from our servers within about 24 hours of processing via a daily
          automated cleanup job, whether or not you download it; this scheduled deletion does not
          depend on the original file's earlier best-effort deletion having succeeded.
        </p>

        <h2>4. How we use information</h2>
        <p>
          We use collected information to operate and improve ConvertBrio, provide customer
          support, monitor for abuse and security incidents, understand aggregate product usage,
          and comply with legal obligations. We do not sell your personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
        <p>
          We and our service providers use cookies and similar technologies (such as local
          storage) for the following purposes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Essential</strong>: keeping you signed in and remembering basic preferences like theme.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics</strong>: understanding aggregate usage via Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity, so we know which tools are useful and where the product breaks.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Advertising</strong>: if and when we display advertisements (for example
            through Google AdSense), Google and other third-party vendors use cookies, including
            the Google advertising cookie, to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or
            other websites. These cookies allow Google and its partners to serve you personalized
            ads. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>,
            or generally at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Where required (including for visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland), we ask for
          your consent before setting non-essential analytics or advertising cookies, using the
          consent banner shown on your first visit. You can change your choice at any time using
          the “Manage cookie preferences” link in the footer of every page. Rejecting non-essential
          cookies does not prevent you from using ConvertBrio’s tools.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Third-party services we use</h2>
        <p>ConvertBrio relies on the following service providers, each of which only receives the information necessary to perform its function:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Vercel</strong>: hosts the site, runs file conversions on its servers (conversions do not happen locally in your browser), and briefly holds your original uploaded file in a private Vercel Blob store until it's read for conversion and deleted.</li>
          <li><strong>Supabase</strong>: stores accounts and temporarily stores the converted output of your file until automatic deletion.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics &amp; Google Tag Manager</strong>: aggregate usage analytics, subject to your cookie consent choice.</li>
          <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong>: aggregate usage analytics and session insights, subject to your cookie consent choice.</li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong>: advertising, once enabled on the site, subject to your cookie consent choice.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell or share this information with any provider beyond what is needed for it to perform the listed function.</p>

        <h2>7. Legal basis and your rights (EEA, UK, and Switzerland)</h2>
        <p>
          Where GDPR or UK GDPR applies, we process your information on the basis of: performing
          our contract with you (providing the tools you use), our legitimate interests (security,
          fraud prevention, and improving the service), and your consent (analytics and
          advertising cookies). You have the right to access, correct, delete, restrict, or
          object to our processing of your personal information, to receive a copy of it in a
          portable format, and to withdraw consent at any time without affecting processing
          carried out before withdrawal. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your
          local data protection supervisory authority. To exercise any of these rights, contact <a href="mailto:subhamsharma@convertbrio.com">subhamsharma@convertbrio.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>8. US state privacy rights</h2>
        <p>
          If you are a resident of a US state with a comprehensive privacy law (such as
          California, Colorado, Connecticut, Virginia, or others), you may have the right to
          know, access, delete, or correct your personal information, and to opt out of its sale
          or “sharing” (including for cross-context behavioral advertising, which some states
          treat advertising cookies as). We do not sell personal information. If we display
          advertising through Google AdSense, this may be considered “sharing” under some state
          laws; you can opt out at any time using the cookie preference link in the footer, the <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a> page,
          or by sending a Global Privacy Control (GPC) signal from your browser, which we
          honor as an opt-out request. To exercise these rights, contact <a href="mailto:subhamsharma@convertbrio.com">subhamsharma@convertbrio.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>9. International data transfers</h2>
        <p>
          ConvertBrio is operated from India and uses service providers (including Vercel and
          Supabase) that may process data in other countries, including the United States. Where
          we transfer personal information internationally, we rely on those providers’
          contractual and technical safeguards to protect it consistently with this policy.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Your original uploaded file is deleted immediately after conversion on a best-effort
          basis. The converted output is deleted within about 24 hours of processing via a daily
          automated cleanup job, which runs on that schedule regardless of whether you download
          the result. Account information is retained for as long as your account is active, plus
          a limited period afterward to comply with legal or security obligations. Security and
          usage logs are retained only for as long as needed for the purposes described above,
          after which they are deleted or anonymized.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p>
          ConvertBrio is intended for users aged 18 and over and is not directed at children. We
          do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 18. If you believe a
          child has provided us with personal information, contact <a href="mailto:subhamsharma@convertbrio.com">subhamsharma@convertbrio.com</a> and we will delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. If we make material changes, we will
          update the “last updated” date at the top of this page and, where appropriate, provide
          additional notice.
        </p>

        <h2>13. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy, or requests to exercise your privacy rights, can be sent
          to <a href="mailto:subhamsharma@convertbrio.com">subhamsharma@convertbrio.com</a> or via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
